ersanantonio.org/agency/detail/?agency_id=16043","source_title":"United Way of San Antonio: The DoSeum","source_kind":"other_reliable","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check the museum’s official site for current admission, timed-entry, and hours information before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"san-antonio-botanical-garden-n-new-braunfels","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"San Antonio Botanical Garden","title":"Botanical Garden: seasonal landscapes","subtitle":"N. New Braunfels Avenue corridor at Funston Place","notes":"Enter from Funston Place and use the garden’s current map and seasonal hours to structure a plant-focused visit through the grounds.","short_summary":"A garden destination at the Funston and North New Braunfels corner.","evidence_claim":"The San Antonio Botanical Garden is at the northeast corner of Funston Place and North New Braunfels Avenue, at 555 Funston Place.","source_url":"https://sabgtx.org/directions-parking/","source_title":"San Antonio Botanical Garden: Directions & Parking","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Hours change seasonally; the garden publishes current seasonal hours and limited free on-site parking for guests.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mcnay-art-museum-n-new-braunfels","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"McNay Art Museum","title":"McNay Art Museum: art and sculpture grounds","subtitle":"N. New Braunfels Avenue corridor","notes":"Bring Trinity identification for the institution’s student-admission benefit, then allow time for galleries and the outdoor sculpture grounds.","short_summary":"An art museum whose student partnership includes Trinity University.","evidence_claim":"McNay Art Museum is at 6000 N. New